# OS
.DS_Store

# Project artefacts
# No corpus is tracked and none is generated: the synthetic pipeline that
# used to fill data/ has been removed, and with it the seed corpus that was
# kept here so a fresh clone could regenerate and falsify the numbers in
# ABLATION_RESULTS.md. Those numbers are withdrawn for exactly that reason --
# see the withdrawal notice. data/ is where you put your own corpus; it is
# ignored because training data does not belong in a source repository.
data/*
!data/.gitkeep
checkpoints/*
!checkpoints/.gitkeep
# runs/*.json are the record of what was executed. The figures they hold are
# withdrawn (see ABLATION_RESULTS.md), and deleting evidence is not the same
# as withdrawing a claim: a reader checking the withdrawal needs them. They
# are 4 KB in total and must travel with the repo; only the bulky logs are
# ignored. vedic/kernel/tests/test_no_withdrawn_number_is_quoted.py reads
# them and fails if any document quotes one.
runs/*
!runs/*.json
wandb/
*.log
